<title>JAPAN: Japan Bridge - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Japan Bridge - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 12.22		vs	   11.06</p>
<p> Operating	  268 million	 vs	  290 million</p>
<p> Current	    259 million	 vs	  125 million</p>
<p> Net		   89 million	 vs	    1.88</p>
<p> EPS		    3.50 yen	  vs	   74.82 yen</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Japan Bridge Corp manufactures steel bridges and towers.</p>
